# Cloudflare Pages / Netlify redirects.
#
# THE PRINTED QR CODE POINTS AT THE FIRST LINE AND NOTHING ELSE.
# Books outlive deployments. Keep this indirection even while it looks pointless:
# it is the only way to move, rename or retire the app without reprinting.
#
# Rules:
#   - encode the short path in the QR code, never the versioned path
#   - no version number, no query string, no URL shortener
#   - 302, not 301: a 301 is cached by the browser effectively forever, which
#     would defeat the entire purpose of having a redirect here

/bone-age    /tools/bone-age/    302
/boneage     /tools/bone-age/    302
